  "details": "v2018.2.3 document removes legacy component VRC_SceneResetPosition page. But this component is still usefull. I think the page should not be remvoed yet.\n\nThe function of VRC_ObjectSync.TeleportTo RPC is similar to VRC_SceneResetPosition.ResetPosition. But currently TeleportTo has problems. It's very inconvenient in some case.\n\n- [TeleportTo targetLocation becomes None after hierarchy edit](https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/teleportto-targetlocation-becomes-none-after-hierarchy-edit)\n- [VRC_ObjectSync.TeleportTo by non-owner may cause location desync](https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrcobjectsyncteleportto-by-non-owner-may-cause-location-desync)\n- [VRC_ObjectSync.TeleportTo target object moves back when opening SendRPC edit form again](https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrcobjectsyncteleportto-target-object-moves-back-when-opening-sendrpc-edit-form-1)\n- [VRC_ObjectSync.TeleportTo changes target location object rotation if its parent moves](https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrcobjectsyncteleportto-changes-target-location-object-rotation-if-its-parent-mo)\n- VRC_SceneResetPosition has \"Remove Velocity\" option. TeleportTo doesn't.\n- VRC_SceneResetPosition also resets scale of object transform. TeleportTo doesn't.\n",
  "error": null,
